  "synopsis": "When Wen Yifan returned to her hometown for work, she unexpectedly ran into the rumored \"First-Class Handsome Guy\" at a bar. However, she soon discovered that he was Sang Yan, someone she had hurt and rejected in high school. In a twist of fate, these two individuals who could never get along found themselves constantly crossing paths. They even ended up renting the same unit by chance and becoming housemates. With unspoken feelings buried deep within, strong emotions begin to stir...\n\nLet's see how Sang Yan, the \"Peak Ideal Boyfriend,\" interprets and expresses his profound affection and sweet love!\n\n(Source: INKR)",
